# Blanks are only U+0020 and U+0009 (STXT-SPEC section 4). Any other Unicode space,
# such as the no-break space U+00A0 used here, is content: it is neither trimmed nor
# does it make a line empty.
Root (com.example.nbsp):
	Trailing: Joan 
	Leading: Joan
	Only: 
	Block >>
		first 
		 
		in the middle
